From: richie-rich90454 <rjiang880@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 0003/0014] Replace icons and fonts

This patch replaces every SVG, PNG, and ICO with our asset of the same
dimensions, and swaps Cascadia Code/Mono for JetBrains Mono (OFL 1.1)
and Segoe UI for the system font stack.

Rationale: upstream icons are Microsoft trademarks; Cascadia lacks a
compatible license story for our build.

Touches:
  - resources/, extensions/*/resources/ (binary assets)
  - workbench font stacks

Asset inventory: ide/branding/icons/inventory.md (authored with the assets).

Diff: authored on the upstream checkout (see build.sh).
Verification: no Microsoft trademarked asset remains; fonts render in smoke.
